<h1 style="font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;">{{tenant_name}}</h1>
<p>Hello,</p>
<p>A transfer of {{tenant_name}} was reported as abusive.</p>
<p>Transfer: <strong>{{transfer_id}}</strong><br>Sender: <strong>{{sender_email}}</strong><br>Category: <strong>{{category}}</strong></p>
<p>{{reporter_notice}}</p>
{{reporter_message}}
<p>The report is not acted upon automatically: review it in the administration.</p>
<p><a href="{{admin_link}}" style="padding:12px 20px;background-color:#1a1a1a;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;border-radius:4px;">Open the reports</a></p>
<p>If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br><span style="word-break:break-all;">{{admin_link}}</span></p>
<hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid #767676;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p style="font-size:14px;color:#4a4a4a;">This message was sent automatically by {{tenant_name}}. Please do not reply to it.</p>
